<p>Hi <%= @user.displayed_name %>,</p>

<p>Thank you for your interest in joining <strong><%= @tenant.name %></strong> as an expert.</p>

<p>After careful review, we're unable to approve your application at this time.</p>

<% if @reason.present? %>
<div class="detail-box">
  <p><strong>Feedback from our review team:</strong></p>
  <p><%= @reason %></p>
</div>
<% end %>

<p>We encourage you to address the feedback above and reapply in the future. If you have any questions, please reach out to our support team.</p>

<p>Thank you for your understanding.</p>

<p>The <%= @tenant.name %> Team</p>
